</h2>


        




<h2  class="c-step-name" aria-disabled="false" >
  2. Platform:
  
    <img alt="Choose from the list below" class="c-step-icon" src="https://www.mozilla.org/media/protocol/img/icons/caret-down.25bcb9d16ae5.svg" width="30" height="30">
  

  
  <a id="icon-installer-help" href="#installer-help" class="c-button-help icon-installer-help" title="Aprende mas sobre instaladors">
    Obtener aduya
  </a>
  
</h2>


  <div class="c-step-contents">
    <ul class="c-platform-list">
      
        <li><a href="/an/firefox/all/desktop-esr/win64/">Windows 64-bit</a></li>
      
        <li><a href="/an/firefox/all/desktop-esr/win64-msi/">Windows 64-bit MSI</a></li>
      
        <li><a href="/an/firefox/all/desktop-esr/win64-aarch64/">Windows ARM64/AArch64</a></li>
      
        <li><a href="/an/firefox/all/desktop-esr/win/">Windows 32-bit</a></li>
      
